{"articleNo":"76735","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=76735&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"구미지역 통학버스 운행시간 조정 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.02.19","hit":"6565","attachments":[{"name":"구미지역셔틀버스(2013. 3. 2.).xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=76735&attachNo=71855"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">우</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">리대학교 학생 및 교직원의 등·하교 편의를 제공하기 위하여 구미</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">지역 통학버스 운행시간을 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">붙임과 같이 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">조정하여 운행하니 참고하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp; 1. 통학버스 운행 시간표 : 붙임</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp; 2. 시행기간 : </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">2013. 3. 4.(월)부터 추후 운행시간 조정시 까지</span></u></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (단, 공휴일 및 휴무일 제외)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp; 3. 조정사유 : 개학으로 인한 승차 인원 증가</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp; 4. 하교시 학교 출발장소 : 다목적운동장 뒤편 버스주차장</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">붙임 구미지역 통학버스 운행노선 및 시간표 1부. 끝.</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">사 무 국 장</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
